Audio: original mathematical synthesis in mix.py, generated noise beds and short plucked/bell notes.
No narration, voice cloning or online TTS. No audio samples from the upstream demo.

Tools (not screen assets): Python, NumPy, SciPy, Pillow, SoundFile, fontTools, Playwright Core, Google Chrome, FFmpeg.
No LemoLab logo, upstream demo sign-off or watermark appears in the film.
